WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.910
Every Wednesday, this funnel report ends in one decision, and a prediction of what that decision will change.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:20.510
It opens with the one move with the greatest impact. This week, thirty one of sixty six new accounts pressed play on the welcome video. The move predicts eighty in a hundred.

3
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:28.240
The same move leads the Wednesday email, so nobody has to open the report to know what happens next.

4
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:40.460
Under the move sit the ten numbers that matter most, ranked by how far each is from its target. Take the tour, and the report walks you through all ten.

5
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:51.930
Each stop scrolls to the chart behind the number, starting with where sign-ups really come from: which ad sources convert, and which only bring traffic.

6
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:04.010
Stop two is this week's move: thirty one of sixty six pressed play. Stop three is why every fix is judged on a phone first: almost every visitor is on one.

7
00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:12.510
The rest of the tour finds the leaks: where visitors stop reading the page, and how long a visit really lasts.

8
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:26.550
Every move ships with a prediction, and the hypothesis board grades each one against the new week. All three graded predictions are holding.

9
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:36.400
The Access your account button was one of them. Sixty six of eighty two new accounts went in, against none of five before it.

10
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:47.930
Each edition re-scores every move from scratch. The star changed once, on the twelfth of November, and moved back as more people reached the video.

11
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:55.690
Every step is held against its own target, so the next prediction starts where the gap is widest.

12
00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:04.370
It also says what it cannot see yet, and names the build that would close each gap.

13
00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:18.820
Four editions in eight days, each ending in one move. This week's move predicts eighty in a hundred, and the report grades it on the twenty fifth of November.

14
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:24.840
One move a week, each with a prediction, graded the following Wednesday.
